      "mergeID": "6a309f64f991671bb3b7cd1a",
      "mergedPostDetails": "When you press the unfriend button on the web, it immediately removes the friend, so I accidentally unfriended someone important. Then I had to send them a friend request again.\n\nAlso, if you don't realize you accidentally unfriended someone, you might mistakenly think they unfriended you.\n\nSo please add a confirmation prompt asking if you really want to unfriend them when you press the unfriend button!!",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Add a confirmation prompt when the “Unfriend” button is clicked on the web.",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "65140f6b612a5c09c78df1db",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 2
      },
      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be so helpful, I just came here cause I did the same thing of accedentally unfriending someone.\n\nHaving a promt would be so helpful ;v;",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
