      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "6a309f87fd8262dc2ff0ae64",
      "mergedPostDetails": "As the title suggests, when you open a friend on the website, the Unfriend button is prominently displayed, and the moment you press it by mistake, the friend is deleted without any confirmation screen.\n\nI think this will develop into a major community problem.\n\nAt the very least, there should be a confirmation screen after clicking.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "UI problem of being able to delete friends with one click.",
